extends ../../../layouts/master.pug

block title
  title NBC Covenant Partners | Ministry Tuition Assistance
  meta(name='description', content='View current NBC Covenant Partner districts and learn how these partnerships support ministry tuition assistance.')

block header
  include ../../../components/header.pug

block content
  section.section-box
    .banner-hero.bg-about-3
      .container
        .row
          .col-lg-12.text-center
            h1.text-display-2.color-gray-900 NBC Covenant Partners
            p.text-body-lead-large.color-gray-600.mt-30
              | Districts partnering with NBC to make ministry preparation more affordable.

  section.section-box.mt-60.mb-50
    .container
      .content-detail
        .row
          .col-lg-2
          .col-lg-8
            h2.text-heading-4 Covenant Partner Districts
            p.text-body-text.mt-30
              | NBC has covenant partnership agreements with the following districts for the 2025-2026 academic year. Students from churches in these districts may be eligible for Covenant Partner Scholarship support.

            .row.mt-40
              .col-lg-4.col-md-6.col-sm-12
                .card-grid-style-3.bd-bg-6.pb-40.mb-30
                  h3.text-heading-5 21 Partner Districts
                  p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-15
                    | Districts across the United States are participating in the current academic year.
              .col-lg-4.col-md-6.col-sm-12
                .card-grid-style-3.bd-bg-9.pb-40.mb-30
                  h3.text-heading-5 Tuition Support
                  p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-15
                    | Eligible students may receive scholarship help for NBC degree and certificate programs.
              .col-lg-4.col-md-6.col-sm-12
                .card-grid-style-3.bd-bg-10.pb-40.mb-30
                  h3.text-heading-5 Shared Mission
                  p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-15
                    | Covenant partnerships connect local church giving with preparation for future ministry.

            .card-grid-style-2.card-square.mt-20
              .d-flex.justify-content-between.align-items-center.flex-wrap
                h3.text-heading-5.mb-10 2025-2026 Partner List
                p.text-body-small.color-gray-600.mb-10
                  | Current as listed by NBC
              .table-responsive.mt-20
                table.table.table-striped
                  thead
                    tr
                      th(scope='col') District
                      th(scope='col') Status
                  tbody
                    tr
